{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642050","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1064205001:0":{"text":"梦境之中，埃因的身影散去后，一个梦幻而俊美的独角兽轮廓在奥萝菈身侧缓缓勾勒出来。","source_cn":"梦境之中，埃因的身影散去后，一个梦幻而俊美的独角兽轮廓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B4E02AFF55AEADE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064205002:0":{"text":"哼……这场混乱的噩梦总算了结了。","source_cn":"哼……这场混乱的噩梦总算了结了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2027CF91C968B413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064205003:0":{"text":"我得说句实话，奥萝菈。比起他的双腿，我更为他的头脑担心——他竟然连自己的心愿是什么都不知道！天哪！","source_cn":"我得说句实话，奥萝菈。比起他的双腿，我更为他的头脑担心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E8CF7CFA9C9CBE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064205004:0":{"text":"也许是因为，他不敢幻想双腿还能康复，唯恐希望落空，被更可怕的绝望所吞噬……","source_cn":"也许是因为，他不敢幻想双腿还能康复，唯恐希望落空，被更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43DDAAD4ADB3E253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064205005:1":{"text":"你知道吗？桑尼，其实，我很能理解那种心情……","source_cn":"你知道吗？桑尼，其实，我很能理解那种心情……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE163F269AF705B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064205006:1":{"text":"亲爱的奥萝菈，你唯一的缺点就是太过善良了。","source_cn":"亲爱的奥萝菈，你唯一的缺点就是太过善良了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC09C30463DB8D66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064205007:1":{"text":"要我说，直接让我进入他的梦境，用潇洒的身姿扫除战火啊、魔物啊那些讨人厌的东西，他就不会再做噩梦了。","source_cn":"要我说，直接让我进入他的梦境，用潇洒的身姿扫除战火啊、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F0B08210ED2620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064205008:1":{"text":"节省下来的时间，让你多休息一会儿，美美地睡上一觉，那该有多好！","source_cn":"节省下来的时间，让你多休息一会儿，美美地睡上一觉，那该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1B1CDCDA2347947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064205009:1":{"text":"或许……是因为我在埃因身上看到了自己，所以才格外细致地处理这场噩梦……","source_cn":"或许……是因为我在埃因身上看到了自己，所以才格外细致地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x948729CFA25B73C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064205010:1":{"text":"什——什么？！他除了心地还不错之外，有哪点能和你相较？更别提和你相像了！","source_cn":"什——什么？！他除了心地还不错之外，有哪点能和你相较？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61164BCDA523C210","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064205011:1":{"text":"但是，我也曾经和他一样……因为腿疾，被永远地困在床榻上。","source_cn":"但是，我也曾经和他一样……因为腿疾，被永远地困在床榻上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4804EB3B69F29592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064205012:1":{"text":"那时的我，还没有受到艾雅女神的眷顾，被擢升为半神……","source_cn":"那时的我，还没有受到艾雅女神的眷顾，被擢升为半神……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F9252DFF6A5FEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064205013:0":{"text":"那不是什么值得珍藏的回忆……它宛如一场幽深绝望的噩梦，漫长到不知道何时才能醒来。","source_cn":"那不是什么值得珍藏的回忆……它宛如一场幽深绝望的噩梦，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x267DB80165E7C107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064205014:0":{"text":"对那时的我来说，睡觉就是最幸福的事……因为在梦里，我可以短暂地逃离病痛……","source_cn":"对那时的我来说，睡觉就是最幸福的事……因为在梦里，我可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38E4F9B97C7E66C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064205015:0":{"text":"我常常向艾雅女神祈祷，祈祷自己能不再醒来。","source_cn":"我常常向艾雅女神祈祷，祈祷自己能不再醒来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2C2F581B8A1144B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064205016:1":{"text":"那样的话，我的家人不必再担忧。而我……也不必再忍受痛苦。","source_cn":"那样的话，我的家人不必再担忧。而我……也不必再忍受痛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89D36DACDC234778","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064205017:1":{"text":"噢……抱歉，奥萝菈，我没有想惹你伤心……","source_cn":"噢……抱歉，奥萝菈，我没有想惹你伤心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6DA50DE207D8617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064205018:1":{"text":"没关系……你看，现在，我已经不会再被病魔所困了。","source_cn":"没关系……你看，现在，我已经不会再被病魔所困了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x935A66CC48B7BE30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064205019:1":{"text":"不过，正是因为经历过卧病在床的绝望，我才格外理解埃因心中的苦闷……","source_cn":"不过，正是因为经历过卧病在床的绝望，我才格外理解埃因心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16325DCC0DF7709A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064205020:1":{"text":"何况……他的梦魇，来源于那场战争……","source_cn":"何况……他的梦魇，来源于那场战争……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE91DC47746B6C373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064205021:1":{"text":"战争给他带来的创伤，不在肉体……而在心灵。","source_cn":"战争给他带来的创伤，不在肉体……而在心灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1DD221CC5912D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064205022:1":{"text":"如果我们不能治愈他内心的创伤，即便清除了噩梦，也许几年……甚至几个月之后，噩梦又将卷土重来……","source_cn":"如果我们不能治愈他内心的创伤，即便清除了噩梦，也许几年...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8929184606B99CFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064205023:1":{"text":"唉！幸好不是每个凡人的梦境都这么麻烦。","source_cn":"唉！幸好不是每个凡人的梦境都这么麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD23F160B60D42DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064205024:1":{"text":"我还是更喜欢那些只有野兽、幽灵出没的噩梦。稍微踹它们一脚，恐吓两句，它们就会被吓得灰溜溜逃跑，哼哼。","source_cn":"我还是更喜欢那些只有野兽、幽灵出没的噩梦。稍微踹它们一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC1D738D908B1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064205025:1":{"text":"“安抚世间绝望之人，为他们创造美丽的梦境……最重要的是，让他们从梦中获得面对绝望的力量。”","source_cn":"“安抚世间绝望之人，为他们创造美丽的梦境……最重要的是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F86CE6F29FE7425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064205026:1":{"text":"这是艾雅女神留给我的嘱托……","source_cn":"这是艾雅女神留给我的嘱托……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72756B1985642E3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064205027:1":{"text":"为了把大家都变得和你一样无忧无虑，我们得加油了，桑尼。","source_cn":"为了把大家都变得和你一样无忧无虑，我们得加油了，桑尼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF075BFE1F12A0B4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064205028:1":{"text":"无忧无虑？哪里无忧无虑？我要操心的事可太多了！","source_cn":"无忧无虑？哪里无忧无虑？我要操心的事可太多了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FD614CFB6D09097","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064205029:1":{"text":"除了清除凡人的噩梦，还要防着塔西那个坏心眼的小蝴蝶跑到你梦里胡闹！她惹祸的能力简直——噢，我一提到她就脑袋痛……","source_cn":"除了清除凡人的噩梦，还要防着塔西那个坏心眼的小蝴蝶跑到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x899A714CEDCB19FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064205030:1":{"text":"好了，好了……不要激动，桑尼。","source_cn":"好了，好了……不要激动，桑尼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C0592763C49DAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064205031:1":{"text":"现在还不是休息的时候。有很多人仍深陷绝望之中，等待着梦境的抚慰……","source_cn":"现在还不是休息的时候。有很多人仍深陷绝望之中，等待着梦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E25597208FCCCCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064205032:1":{"text":"我们现在就出发吧……去下一场梦境。","source_cn":"我们现在就出发吧……去下一场梦境。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C50A4CC4AA769A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064205033:1":{"text":"但愿，战争带来的创伤，能早日从伊索米亚……也从凡人的梦境中离去。","source_cn":"但愿，战争带来的创伤，能早日从伊索米亚……也从凡人的梦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A9C0718D5AF938E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064205034:1":{"text":"好好好……都听你的，亲爱的奥萝菈。","source_cn":"好好好……都听你的，亲爱的奥萝菈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8211E1408526A659","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064205035:1":{"text":"有你庇护他们的梦境，连我都替这些凡人感到荣幸呢。","source_cn":"有你庇护他们的梦境，连我都替这些凡人感到荣幸呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB249987B69D26A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"旁白","source":"旁白","status":"source"},"speaker:桑尼":{"text":"桑尼","source":"桑尼","status":"source"},"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"奥萝菈","source":"奥萝菈","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":36,"localized_text_count":35,"speaker_count":3}}